      <description>&lt;p&gt;Since 2019, I have been a professor emeritus at the Université de Montréal. I taught there for 40 years in the Department of Computer Science and Operations Research, working primarily in natural language processing within the RALI laboratory. Until September 2026, I served as the academic lead for the &lt;a href=&#34;https://mona.iro.umontreal.ca/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;MONA&lt;/a&gt; project.&lt;/p&gt;
